# Chess Openings — O2Switch/cPanel weekly PHP importer (EXAMPLE; NOT INSTALLED)
# The single scheduled job runs the complete import in Symfony/PHP:
# fetch Lichess TSVs -> validate moves -> stage MariaDB -> safely promote new revision.
# Requires deployed, tested app:openings:sync Symfony Console command.
# Application deployment polling is a separate job; see plan section 14.
#
# Every Monday at 05:17 in HOST server's cron timezone (verify before enabling).
# Adapt all placeholder paths and PHP CLI version to the actual hosting account.
# O2Switch documents /opt/alt/php83/usr/bin/php as an example PHP 8.3 binary;
# do not assume that is the version configured on the actual site.
# The template releases the backend at current/ (no backend/ segment).
# The installed wrapper rotates private shared/log/openings-sync.log independently of deployment logs.
#
17 5 * * 1 /bin/bash /home/ACCOUNT/apps/chess-openings/control/opening-sync.sh /opt/alt/php83/usr/bin/php
#
# Optional manual checks (replace paths/version):
# /opt/alt/php83/usr/bin/php /home/ACCOUNT/apps/chess-openings/current/bin/console app:openings:sync --env=prod --no-debug --dry-run --no-interaction
# /opt/alt/php83/usr/bin/php /home/ACCOUNT/apps/chess-openings/current/bin/console app:openings:status --env=prod --no-debug
#
# Symfony command must hold an import lock; unchanged data => successful no-op.
# Invalid data/network failures => nonzero exit without changing active revision.
# Do NOT schedule an additional GitHub Actions or secondary importer cron.
# Cron details: https://faq.o2switch.fr/cpanel/outils-avances/tache-planifiee-cron/
